{"c":[{"name":"20261003T141909Z-1887ef6a0983e76b","text":"Helper memoryRequest has no add op and records no permission uses; the host's contract for both is apps/caret/Tests/CaretHostCoreTests/Fixtures/memory.ndjson, and typed values wait in MemoryBook (memory only) until a helper accepts add (A11).","type":"note"},{"name":"20261003T141909Z-b0300a8600af9266","text":"ImageRenderer cannot draw TextField or ScrollView: Caret windows use EntryField and ScrollingColumn (Design/EntryField.swift), which draw still stand-ins when Gallery.png sets rendersOffscreen (A11).","type":"note"}]}
